[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6663.43, "timestamp": "01:51:03", "text": "我是哑巴吗？搞什么鬼？我静音了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6667.35, "timestamp": "01:51:07", "text": "我。不，我一直在说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6688.87, "timestamp": "01:51:28", "text": "为什么？你知道吗？我应该把它做成呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6691.35, "timestamp": "01:51:31", "text": "我的天哪，有好多东西要收拾呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6693.91, "timestamp": "01:51:33", "text": "我脑子里一直想着我必须解决这个问题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6696.709, "timestamp": "01:51:36", "text": "实现自动化。但我认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6699.109, "timestamp": "01:51:39", "text": "能听到你说话。等等，你是？嗯？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6702.149, "timestamp": "01:51:42", "text": "不知道。我刚才看到了麦克风。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6705.03, "timestamp": "01:51:45", "text": "是啊，麦克风的灯关了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6706.109, "timestamp": "01:51:46", "text": "而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6709.03, "timestamp": "01:51:49", "text": "等等，我刚才是不是静音了？还是我说话了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6711.91, "timestamp": "01:51:51", "text": "关于这些东西？嗨。我再说一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6714.27, "timestamp": "01:51:54", "text": "呃，我不知道我从哪儿来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6718.629, "timestamp": "01:51:58", "text": "静音。嗯，是的，所以我刚才说的是……"}]